{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"「新年へのカウントダウン、始めました。北野日奈子です。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！21回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nフーテンさんから頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/28/1301664/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よそ見している\n君の胸に向かって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がおっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/28/1301664/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キタノはキタノ\nヒナコはコナイ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の2番の歌詞から！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/28/1301664/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は名古屋で今年最後の個別握手会がありました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスは終わっていたけど\n私のレーンは生誕委員の方々が可愛くクリスマス仕様にデコレーションして下さっていて\nまだまだクリスマスでした(｡・・｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、今年の慌てん坊のひなサンタは\nクリスマス前でも後でもなく\nクリスマスに名古屋の\n北野日奈子レーンにいたよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ね？そうだよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだよ！だから、\n1部から3部までノリノリで\nひなサンタだったよー！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/28/1301664/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まきまき\nりんごヘアー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/28/1301664/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここスカートのベルト\n偽物なんだよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/28/1301664/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/28/1301664/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年がワンピースの形した\nサンタさんだったから今年は違う形にしたんだけど、トップスがちょっと短くて\nスカートもゆるくて\nお腹が見えちゃうの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会中、何度もトップスを下に引っ張ってたから何人かのファンの方に\nなにしてるんだ？って思われたと思います！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへへ(｡・・｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/28/1301664/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろにある誰かの充電器が\nシュール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/28/1301664/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部だけ\n外ハネでした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/28/1301664/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が会いに来て下さって\n本当に嬉しかったです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋での握手会は\n関東の会場に普段来られない方も\nたくさん来てくださるので\n半年ぶりだったり何ヶ月ぶりだったりと\n1年のうちの、\nたまにしか会うことができなくて\n久しぶりになってしまうんですが、\n前に会いに来て下さった時のことを\n覚えていて\n皆さん髪型や髪色が変わったり\nそんなところの変化も\n感じられるので\nそういう部分では関東会場ではあまり\n味わえない部分なので新鮮で楽しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また何ヶ月も会えない方や\n勉強やお仕事で忙しく会えない方が\nたくさんいらっしゃって\nとても寂しいですが\n次会える時を楽しみにして\n私は頑張ります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも一緒に頑張りましょう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末で忙しい中\n私に会いに来てくださり\n本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/28/1301664/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サカサマ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/28/1301664/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/28/1301664/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短いですが\n今日はこのへんで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n14回目はたかゆきさんからです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「私を応援してくれる...みんなの事......ずっと......ずっと.........好」ピー"}],"source":"archive"}